  "implementation": [
    "Native navigation distance fields, shared nearest-city ownership maps, numeric search workspaces, and indexed placement occupancy replace repeated full-world/building scans.",
    "Route requests, governor decisions, hidden formations and recurring maintenance are scheduled across frames while preserving elapsed economic time and live collision checks.",
    "Invalidated existing ownership maps refresh one faction per simulation step; standalone queries remain exact. Farm relocation uses lazy exact distance ordering and persistent private preview worlds.",
    "Road display previews approximate farm relocation. Singleplayer road orders validate/pay one cell per eligible frame; unavailable relocations reject safely. Cleanup runs in separate phases even while paused. Public/server buildStroke stays synchronous.",
    "Render caches retain sprites/range geometry, update only dirty terrain, and reuse enclosure shimmer textures. No visible actor cap was introduced.",
    "Chunked cooperative autosave serialization removes the large periodic main-thread pause. Explicit writes are queued and the synchronous unload checkpoint remains."
  ],
