  "limitations": [
    "Cold first-live-frame cache initialization remains visible:170 ms in final no-input replay and 203 ms in final road replay.",
    "Occasional heavy frames remain above 33.3 ms: final no-input steady p 9940.2 ms/max 63.8 ms; road p 9949.2 ms/max 75.2 ms. The 30 fps target is sustained throughput with 95% of measured work within budget, not a hard real-time guarantee.",
    "Road previews can be optimistic when a farm has no replacement plot; each purchase still checks current placement, relocation, connectivity and treasury. Orders and staffing settle over several frames.",
    "Large simultaneous movement orders may wait for a bounded route-search queue. During extreme overload, the game limits catch-up work rather than entering a growing simulation backlog.",
    "Performance numbers are specific to this machine, viewport and fixtures. Unbounded worker counts or arbitrary hardware cannot be guaranteed.",
    "The 2,000-worker stress case has a 341 ms cold first live frame; steady work p95 is 21.7 ms and p99 is 40.6 ms. Its final 1,999 workers reflect verified natural consolidation of two neighboring farm parcels, with all fields and population preserved."
  ],
